  "body": "v1.61.1 release dramatically reduced federation sender calls to the `_get_joined_profile_from_event_id` cache (see: https://github.com/matrix-org/synapse/pull/12955#issuecomment-1162800438). This seems to have returned in 1.63.1, the jump below is when we upgraded from 1.61.1 -> 1.63.1:\r\n\r\n<img width=\"1235\" alt=\"Screenshot 2022-08-03 at 10 06 19\" src=\"https://user-images.githubusercontent.com/1026154/182570006-5cdca47a-4779-498a-9c60-24ef72102f9b.png\">\r\n\r\n",
